WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.075
Unit 3 begins with the plan.

2
00:00:02.075 --> 00:00:07.013
It compares the files with the tenant
and gives each policy one of six actions.

3
00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:09.851
Create, when the policy
isn't in the tenant,

4
00:00:09.851 --> 00:00:14.776
and a new policy is always created
report-only, whatever its ring's state.

5
00:00:14.776 --> 00:00:19.550
Update, when it differs; the patch
carries only the properties that changed.

6
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.600
No change, when it matches.

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.507
Blocked, for a location policy whose named

8
00:00:24.507 --> 00:00:27.912
location doesn't exist yet;
the next run creates it.

9
00:00:27.912 --> 00:00:32.676
Held, when the ring is marked for
enforcement but this run may not enforce it.

10
00:00:32.676 --> 00:00:36.648
And not in repository, for a
workload policy that no file names,

11
00:00:36.648 --> 00:00:39.063
such as one someone made in the portal.

12
00:00:39.063 --> 00:00:41.000
It's reported and left alone.

13
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.863
The code has no delete at all.

14
00:00:42.863 --> 00:00:46.968
Rollback drops the ring from the
enforcement record and applies,

15
00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:49.390
so its policies go back to report-only.
